<title>UK: TABLE-Cookson pre-tax profits 85.4 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Cookson pre-tax profits 85.4 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		   8.7		 vs    8.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    4.1		 vs    3.9</p>
<p> Pretax*			85.4		 vs   85.3</p>
<p> Turnover		    990		   vs  933</p>
<p>NOTE - *The profits are pre-exceptionals. Post exceptional profits remained same in the current year but is comparable to 69.2 million stg in the previous year.</p>
<p>Analysts expected the profits to be between 82.5 and 85.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Cookson Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
